# Compiled compendium packs. Build output of tools/foundry/build_pack.py in
# the Cinderfall site repo, generated from packs-source/**.json. LevelDB is a
# binary directory that rewrites whole segments on every build, so it does not
# belong in git while this module is installed locally via sync-to-foundry.py.
#
# Resolved 2026-09-13: ships in the release artifact instead (the v0.3.0
# GitHub release zip bundles a real built packs/ copied in at package time),
# not by un-ignoring it here. Still git-ignored on purpose -- a new release
# means rebuilding this locally and re-zipping it in, not committing it.
packs/

__pycache__/
